  "actions": [
    {
      "category": "defensive",
      "cost": "reaction",
      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The dragon is targeted with an attack</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The dragon raises a wing, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack. If the dragon is Flying, they descend 10 feet after the attack.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Wing Deflection",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [],
      "trigger": "The dragon is targeted with an attack"
    },
    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "1",
      "description": "<p>If the next action the dragon uses is Breath Weapon, the magma clings to those it damages. Each creature that fails its save against the Breath Weapon takes @Damage[5d6[persistent,fire]] damage, and as long as it has this persistent fire damage, it also takes a -10-foot status penalty to its Speeds.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Volcanic Purge",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "2",
      "description": "<p>The dragon breathes a blast of magma that deals @Damage[10d6[fire],5d12[bludgeoning]|options:area-damage]{10d6 fire damage and 5d12 bludgeoning damage} in a @Template[cone|distance:60] (@Check[reflex|dc:40|basic|options:area-effect] save).</p>\n<p>They can't use Breath Weapon again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Breath Weapon]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Breath Weapon",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [
        "fire",
        "primal"
      ],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "2",
      "description": "<p>Once per day, the dragon can spit a molten boulder at a target within 120 feet. This deals @Damage[12d6[fire],5d12[bludgeoning]]{12d6 fire damage and 5d12 bludgeoning damage}, with a @Check[reflex|dc:42|basic] save. If the creature fails its save, it's encased in magma that instantly cools and has Hardness 10, HP 40, and BT 20. The encased creature can't breathe and is Restrained (Escape DC 42).</p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Magma Tomb",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "defensive",
      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "+1 Status to All Saves vs. Magic",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "interaction",
      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "<p><p>A constant spell affects the monster without the monster needing to cast it, and its duration is unlimited. If a constant spell gets counteracted, the monster can reactivate it by spending the normal spellcasting actions the spell requires.</p></p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Constant Spells",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
      "category": "defensive",
      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "<p>90 feet. @Check[will|dc:37]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><p>A creature that first enters the area must attempt a Will save.</p>\n<p>Regardless of the result of the saving throw, the creature is temporarily immune to this monster's Frightful Presence for 1 minute.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected by the presence.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is Frightened 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is Frightened 2.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is Frightened 4.</p></p>",
      "frequency": null,
      "name": "Frightful Presence",
      "requirements": null,
      "traits": [
        "aura",
        "emotion",
        "fear",
        "mental"
      ],
      "trigger": null
    },
    {
